      "SecondaryAttribute": "User's Vague Prompt\n    \n      \"Cultural diversity is said to be a perk of trave...",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"Cultural diversity is said to be a perk of traveling to Asia. (Diversity – ambiguous perk)\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Cultural Diversity Score in Asia</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Cultural Diversity Score in Asia' bar chart shows the cultural diversity index for China, India, and Japan, highlighting the vast differences in cultural richness across these Asian countries.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Cultural Diversity vs Popularity</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Cultural Diversity vs Popularity' scatter plot reveals a correlation between the cultural diversity and the popularity of travel destinations in Asia, indicating that diversity might be a factor in attracting tourists.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Cultural Diversity and Review Count</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Multi-type chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Cultural Diversity and Review Count' chart combines cultural diversity scores with the number of travel reviews for China, India, and Japan, suggesting a potential link between the diversity of a country and its tourist feedback.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Asia Travel Popularity Over Time</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Line chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Asia Travel Popularity Over Time' line graph shows the changing trends in Asian travel popularity over time, providing valuable insights for predicting future tourism trends.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
