      "SecondaryAttribute": "User's Vague Prompt\n    \n      \"Affording a trip to popular places often seems t...",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"Affording a trip to popular places often seems tricky. (Popularity + Cost – subjective difficulty)\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Travel Cost vs Popularity</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Travel Cost vs Popularity' bar chart presents the average cost of traveling to popular destinations like Paris, New York, and Tokyo, alongside their respective popularity scores, giving a clear picture of expense versus appeal.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Safety vs Popularity</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Safety vs Popularity' scatter plot illustrates the relationship between the safety scores and popularity of Paris, New York, and Tokyo, offering insights into how safety perceptions might affect a destination's popularity.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Popularity Trend Over Time</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Line chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Popularity Trend Over Time' line chart shows how the popularity of Paris, New York, and Tokyo has evolved over time, helping you to identify if these destinations are becoming more or less popular.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Travel Cost Distribution</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Pie chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Travel Cost Distribution' pie chart provides a breakdown of the travel costs for popular destinations like Paris, New York, and Tokyo, allowing you to understand where most of your budget might be spent.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
