        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"Some lesser-known places offer unexpected affordability. (Cost + Popularity – surprising undervalue)\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Unexpected Affordability by Region</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Unexpected Affordability by Region' bar chart reveals that Bhutan, Montenegro, and Nicaragua are surprisingly affordable destinations, highlighting the average daily cost travelers can expect in these less-visited regions.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Popularity of Lesser-known Destinations</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Line chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Popularity of Lesser-known Destinations' line chart shows an increasing trend in the popularity of Bhutan, Montenegro, and Nicaragua, suggesting these lesser-known destinations are gaining attention among travelers.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Safety vs Popularity for Undervalued Destinations</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Safety vs Popularity for Undervalued Destinations' scatter plot indicates a positive relationship between safety scores and popularity for Bhutan, Montenegro, and Nicaragua, implying that these undervalued destinations are not only affordable but also safe to travel.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Review Score Distribution for Lesser-known Destinations</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Pie chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Review Score Distribution for Lesser-known Destinations' pie chart displays how travelers have rated their experiences in Bhutan, Montenegro, and Nicaragua, providing valuable insight into the quality of these lesser-known travel destinations.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
