      "SecondaryAttribute": "User's Vague Prompt\n    \n      \"Tourist claims can be misleading compared to att...",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"Tourist claims can be misleading compared to attractions. (Attractions + Reviews – unclear disparity)\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Attractions Popularity vs Reviews</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Attractions Popularity vs Reviews' scatter plot shows how the number of reviews for various attractions in Paris, London, and New York relates to their popularity, helping travelers to understand if popular sites live up to their hype.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Disparity in Attraction Claims</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Disparity in Attraction Claims' bar chart reveals the difference between advertised attractions and actual visitor reviews in Europe, North America, and Asia, providing insight into the credibility of tourist claims.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Attractions Review Trend</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Line chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Attractions Review Trend' line chart displays the change in attraction reviews over time in Europe, North America, and Asia, offering travelers a glimpse into the evolving popularity and reputation of these regions.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
